   "description": "Pip, a cheerful toddler (about 1.2 m tall at size 1, a big round head, brown hair with a curl, brown eyes, rosy cheeks, ears and a button nose, an orange T-shirt with a yellow star, blue shorts, bare feet with little toes). Built to touch its own body parts. Named parts: head (the hip pivot: the whole upper body bends from the hips, turn [x, 0, 0] to bend forward), arm_l / arm_r (shoulders, separate, not mirrored: rest [0, 0, 8] / [0, 0, -8]), fore_l / fore_r (elbows, hanging on the arms), leg (both legs and feet), shorts, shirt, ears, nose, hair. Faces +z. Poses for head, shoulders, knees, toes, eyes, ears, mouth and nose are in scripts/series/toybox/rhymes/br04.mjs.",
